{"title":"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/4/e34589691f570c63f2d0b04e536d43ed8b672123.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(4x+5\\pi)=P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/8/088595b3f233df2e10ba879c44f1a8783c84587f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6(8x+10\\pi)=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/d/90dc2713cc60cac3ab030db6383048e2812697bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 2P\\quad \\text{(B) } 4P\\quad \\text{(C) } 6P\\quad \\text{(D) } 8P\\quad \\text{(E) } 18P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"344\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2ef2f543ebfa3bb92ed67697f81392f1aeec73b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x+10\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/4/61421c4a1b8c99f0b87edb13393533e8372d01e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(4x+5\\pi),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" /> and we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/b/e1ba0a0a6120666955b79124fd79e1fb675e101e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2 = 4,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/f/01fa65374046067d7bef876410135ad4bc72ee8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}\\, .$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME\" title=\"1992 AHSME\">1992 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AHSM